# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JS_Barcode_Universal
#
# What this repository publishes is the library and nothing else:
#
#   src/       the source, which is the package
#   bundle/    prebuilt IIFE + ESM, so a <script> tag works with no build step
#   examples/  two runnable demo pages
#
# Everything below is either a local development artefact, a generated file
# that a consumer never needs, or tooling that is deliberately not published.
# The rule of thumb: if it is not required to *use* the library, it does not
# belong in the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Editor and local assistant artefacts ---------------------------------
# Assistant working directories and instruction files are dot-prefixed or
# all-caps by convention; both shapes are covered generically rather than by
# naming individual tools, which dates badly.
.assistant*/
.ai/
.cursor/
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md
*_INSTRUCTIONS.md
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Development tooling and local scripts --------------------------------
# Not published: none of it is needed to use the library, and all of it is
# specific to how the project happens to be developed.
